@startuml Sum_Ssfm_SecOC_ErrorsManager
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_SecOC_ErrorsManager"

**Interfaces Legend**
   //ri101  //: SecOC Verification Status
   //II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
   //II182 //: Debounced Error
   //II150 //: BatteryVoltage 
   //II157 //: DisableDTCs
   //II183 //: Undebounced Error
   //pi144 //: ERRH_SecurityErrorEvent_SetEventStatus
   
endlegend

note top of EC
It is responsible for reading notifications about errors related to the MAC verification and asking the DEM to set/clear the corresponding DTC accordingly.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_SecOC_ErrorsManager] as EC{
	portin ri101
	portout pi144

	[Sum_Ssfm_SecOC_ErrorsManager]  as E
}
   interface II150
   interface II152
   interface II157
   interface II182
   interface II183


  ri101 -> E
  II152 -> E
  II182 -> E
  II150 -> E
  II157 -> E
  E -> II183 
  E -> pi144  


@enduml
